WebOS App Museum II, by webOS Archive (https://appcatalog.webosarchive.org), as packaged for
webOS devices and unchanged here. It is the catalogue Lunacy gets its apps from, so it is
bundled: a fresh install has somewhere to go.

The Museum is itself an Enyo app and runs in Lunacy like any other card. It carries LuneOS's
fixes and enhancements to Palm's original App Catalog client.
